## Third-party notices

This repository interoperates with *Cooking Simulator* (App ID 641320, developed
and published by Big Cheese Studio). It contains no game code.

`data/figure/` contains small icon crops extracted from the game at run time and
used solely for template matching in the perception and GUI code. These assets
remain the property of their respective rights holders and are included only so
that the harness is runnable for research and review. If you redistribute this
repository, review whether you are permitted to pass those crops on, or remove
`data/figure/`. See the "Template assets" section of `README.md`.

Cooking Simulator and all associated assets remain the property of their respective
rights holders.
